scripts\\media\\media_scanner.py.docstring:
Analyze folder structure and generate summary with counts.

Returns:
    Dict with structure:
    {
        'tv_shows': {
            'Show Name': {
                'total_episodes': int,
                'seasons': {
                    1: {'episodes': int, 'files': [...]},
                    2: {'episodes': int, 'files': [...]}
                }
            }
        },
        'movies': {
            'Movie Title': {'count': int, 'files': [...]}
        },
        'totals': {
            'tv_shows': int,
            'total_episodes': int,
            'total_seasons': int,
            'movies': int,
            'other': int
        }
    }
